{"id":"vod_sn_39261","vodId":"39261","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"初音岛","name_cn":"初音岛","date":"2003-01-01","year":"2003","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/1e7652f28a46e6654bc83250fd371435.jpg"},"summary":"在初音岛上，樱花一年四季都在盛开，而我们的故事就发生在这个浪漫的地方。朝仓纯一（泰勇气 配音）是就读于风见学园的高中生，和别人不同的是，他拥有能够看见别人梦境的神奇能力。这一次，他又梦见了那个不知名的女孩，她的音容笑貌是如此的熟悉，可纯一就是记不起她的名字。这天，学 校新来了转学生芳乃樱（田村由香里 配音），令纯一吃惊的是，她竟然就是自己梦中的女孩。原来，樱是纯一幼时的玩伴，两人曾经许下了秘密的约定。　　朝仓音梦（野川樱 配音）对没有血缘关系的哥哥纯一一直有着格外的好感，对于半路杀出的樱，音梦感到很不是滋味，而纯一对樱的热情奔放也深感头痛。在这个樱花盛开的小岛上，在三人之间，会连结出怎样的情感羁绊呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:08:42","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kP06tKyWRh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nvGgDYT3ux1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PJc0YPs8dF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LUZQp9ExEj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YXs8zmHWFY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/d2pifHJuuA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7ebGW5SUC11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5EzPZ6Amq01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EFd2eGSH2i1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jx2KggJ1Kj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sLkmh7s61D1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xvZDgfp3hH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SnmztwJ7GX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eXyYCKXSGS1/video/index.m3u8"},